---
description: SEORANKO doctrine overrides Superpowers skills
alwaysApply: true
---
- Rules in this repo override any skill in .cursor/skills/.
- "Done" = deployed URL re-fetched and asserted. Passing tests alone is not done.
- Detectors, fixers and checks are deterministic code with thresholds. Never prompt-only.
- Push directly to main. Never open a PR or create a worktree for this repo.
- Use TDD for detectors and fixers only. Skip it for copy and config changes.
- Debug with systematic-debugging, but check docs/ known pitfalls first:
  duplicate routes, ID mismatch, data never written, pre-hydration HTML,
  silent fallbacks, fixes that never merged.
- Plans go in docs/plans/. Never include secrets or customer data.
